// personally navigated through afterward) — so correcting a seasonal expense's Payment Source (e.g.
// from the personal-checking default to a credit card) only fixed the CURRENT month's already-posted
// entry; every other already-materialized month (a user might easily have 1-2 years prewarmed
// forward) kept posting to the old, wrong source forever, since nothing ever re-synced them. This
